('JSS1', null, 'Digital Technologies', 'Saving work', 'What should you do to keep changes made to a document?', 'Close the computer without saving.', 'Save the document.', 'Delete the document.', 'Turn off the monitor only.', 'B', 'Saving stores the current changes so they can be opened later.', 'easy', 1),

